    "vin_structure": "17 chars: pos1-3=WMI, pos4-8=VDS, pos9=check_digit, pos10=model_year, pos11=plant, pos12-17=serial",
    "vds_market_split": "Mercedes uses European-format (ZZZ filler pos4-6) for EU-market vehicles and NHTSA-format for US-market vehicles. Most GCC Mercedes carry WDD/WDC (German-built) = European format. 4JG = US-built (Vance, AL) = NHTSA format.",
    "gcc_note": "Mercedes does NOT encode GCC spec in the VIN. AMG Line, Night Package, and premium packages are NOT in the VIN. Thermal spec / climate configuration requires OEM build record or door-jamb sticker.",
    "wdd_vs_wdc": "WDD = Mercedes-Benz AG passenger cars (C/E/S/CLS/CLA etc). WDC = Mercedes-Benz AG SUV/GLE/GLS family. 4JG = US-built GLE/GLS from Vance, Alabama — common in GCC as grey imports.",
    "check_digit_note": "WDD/WDC European-built: pos9 is NOT NHTSA check digit (often 0 or filler). 4JG US-built: NHTSA check digit applies."
  },

